  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.",
    "Mix the grated carrots, diced potatoes, ground turmeric, ground garam masala, salt, and black pepper in a bowl.",
    "Add the chopped onion, chopped green chilies, and thawed lamination puff to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Arrange the dried apricots on the prepared baking sheet.",
    "Drizzle the coconut oil over the apricots and spread the carrot-potato mixture evenly over the top.",
    "Bake for 30 minutes or until the top is crispy and golden brown.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool completely before portioning into individual servings."
